"its center of gravity, which is called the body-fixed coordinate frame. "
"Its axes are represented by the vectors (:math:`b_{x}`, :math:`b_{y}`, "
":math:`b_{z}`). [#f1]_ The equations of motion within the body-fixed "
"frame can be expressed as"
