"linearized around the stationary hover state by looking at small "
"disturbances of the state variables and inputs. This assumes that the "
"parameter :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO<MOT_THST_EXPO>` has been :ref:`set "
"correctly<motor-thrust-scaling>`."
